WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:12.104
Gatherings can award continuing-education credit too, once your organization has the Credit Claiming beta. Open the gathering's Settings and find Continuing education credit.

2
00:00:12.165 --> 00:00:23.269
Turn it on, add the credits each agenda item offers, and apply them to every agenda item. Tick Require an evaluation if guests should answer one first.

3
00:00:23.328 --> 00:00:35.728
Who can claim starts at checked-in guests, because on a gathering the door check-in counts as attending every agenda item. The claim window runs from the end of the gathering for ninety days.

4
00:00:38.863 --> 00:00:50.375
After the gathering, the CE credit step shows how many checked-in guests have claimed. Open it for the claims, credits per agenda item, the audit and a report by credit type.

5
00:00:53.292 --> 00:00:59.860
And on the People tab, everyone who has claimed credit gets a Credit claimed badge.
